<tr><td align=3D"left" class=3D"text" style=3D"background:#FFFFFF;font-size=
:0px;padding:0 16px;word-break:break-word;"><div style=3D"font-family:Georg=
ia, serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;line-height:22px;text-align:left;c=
olor:#121212;">
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Despite being the highest-spending team in=
 Serie A for the past two seasons, Como have pulled off the impressive feat=
 of building a brilliant squad comprised largely of players this email had =
never heard of until <a href=3D"https://ablink.editorial.theguardian.com/ss=
/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ7fIEMgszcCSneHEBgtjhYSJYcaNsDra0BxnPgT0w=
Lr-a4BDJODV0NjT7ZDyJiSl5PtrJ5xu-pMe5IZy8MoE3cC5xgsl-tfEVTPRnaQVis1IoHXoSWDi=
LHj8tTVeZfA4ej5LLI-oFdrWri84685S2AA-GgzGwOmNHFXX4N1qQl2lM8D4VglvgHX6GiLwStn=
JOUn-Yc0fGzfXf6YctsQ2zvujQ0ZxvHpDOTeHWs0t_ZmAgvHuguQjZFqGjetZKwkWguqMXDROUi=
BLUBWrk/4vh/2TM6KNhkR7i_7XGIm4wU_w/h29/h001.9wBmP3k4-GSmpVw4XHZF5UpFZhi-m7D=
o7cN3KGTHqEQ" style=3D"color: #0077B6;">they put Manchester United to the s=
word</a> a fortnight ago. In Nico Paz, they have a genuine superstar in the=
 making, while their highest-profile summer signings were Trevoh Chalobah a=
nd Moise Kean, who were absent from the travelling party due to knack. Desp=
ite witnessing his excellent side become only the second team in Bigger Cup=
 history to score nine goals in one game (we=E2=80=99ll save you a Google: =
Bayern Munich), F=C3=A0bregas went full Billy Buzzkill to ensure his player=
s don=E2=80=99t lose the run of themselves.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">=E2=80=9CIt is a wonderful night for Como,=
 for all our fans and many lads here who are at the start of their careers,=
 but they need to keep their feet on the ground [and in their expensive han=
d-stitched loafers =E2=80=93 Football Daily Ed], be humble, keep learning a=
nd not think everything will go well from here on,=E2=80=9D he harrumphed, =
before taking time out to lavish praise on one individual. =E2=80=9CI=E2=80=
=99m angry over the goal we conceded, as we changed something in our defend=
ing with the three substitutions. Plus it was scored by a former teammate; =
I played with Ruben Aguilar at Monaco and I told him I=E2=80=99d never seen=
 you score a goal like that before!=E2=80=9D It was indeed the pick of the =
10, even if clawing proceedings back to 7-1 felt a bit like throwing a pebb=
le at an approaching Death Star. With nine goals, no socks and a furious he=
ad coach demanding perfection, Como=E2=80=99s Mickey Mouse Club is beginnin=
g to look terrifyingly real.</p>
